      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The township proudly hosts the Lawrence County Fairgrounds and Spartan Park, blending serene agriculture with residential and light industrial zones.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.hickorytownship.com/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A short ride north from Hickory opens the door to Amish country, the quaint village of Volant, and Westminster College in New Wilmington.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
